{
  "bookId": "hero-215102",
  "id": "bond-28564",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28564001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "官人手里拿的是什么，为何封面上有我的照片？\n这上面印着的字是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "《M城最想约会的手办大调查》",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "有失体面，这、这可如何是好？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是我帮你报的名，你很受欢迎。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "如何才能取消这些报道，实在是……实在是太不成体统了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有人总结了你的迷人特质。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "形容我是一个「多情」的人吗？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "对我来说，这的确算是个不错的评价。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "人有万般可爱，「情」之一字当属其中之最。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "既已得到这个评价，是不是说明比起「蛇」，我更像一个「人」呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不用怀疑，你就是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28564012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "能得到官人这般肯定，素贞死而无憾了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
